  "details": "VRChat Creation documentation says and shows the path to be 'VRChat SDK > Samples > Avatar Dynamics Robot Avatar.'\n\nIn more recent SDK versions, there are two different sample avatars named:\n\n- Avatar Dynamics Robot Avatar PC\n\n- Avatar Dynamics Robot Avatar Android\n\n(None specifically for \"mobile\" or iOS, that could be a separate issue).\n\nThe instructions and image in the documentation have become outdated.\n\nURL: https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/creating-your-first-avatar/#try-vrchats-example-avatar\n\nNot really a bug because the intent is understood, but it's a small inconsistency.",
